<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8315 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8315 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8315 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8340 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					 March 5	    March 4</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	     1.8315	     1.8340</p>
<p> Volume traded		     $14.83 million	  $4.93 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
